 kəlɩ kʋpɑntʋ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nɑ ń cɑɑkɩ pɔpɔtʋ nɑ pə́ kəlɩ tɑmpɑnɑ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nɑ nyɑ́ lɑŋlɛ hɛɛnɑ tɔm tənɑ nti tə wɑkələɣɩ tɔɣɔ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tə tənɑ tə kɛ́ kʋkɛkɛɛtʋ kɛ́.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Pə tɔɔ kɛ́ Ɩsɔ kɑ́ wɑkəlɩ-ŋ tɑm tɔɔ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ɩ kɑ́ ləsɩ-ŋ nyɑ́ tɛ nɑ ɩ́ tɛɛnɑ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nɑ ɩ́ kpɛsɩ-ŋ weesuɣu nyə́mɑ tɛ nɑ ɩ́ tɔɣɔnɩ-ŋ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Siɣisilɑɑ kɑ́ nɑ-ɩ nɑ sɔɣɔntʋ kpɑ-wɛ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Pɑɑ woŋɩ-ɩ nɑ pɑ́ tɔŋ sɩ:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ye yʋlʋ kisɑ Ɩsɔ kɛ kpʋlʋɣʋ tʋɣʋ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nɑ ɩ́ hɑ ɩ təɣɩ liɣitee nnɑ ɩ wɑkəlɑ lɛlɑɑ nɑ ɩ hiki tɔ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ɩsənɑ ɩ tɛŋnɑ tɔɣɔlɛ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"Amɑ mɑ wɛ Ɩsɔ təyɑɣɑ tɑɑ kɛ́ ɩsɩɩ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"tʋɣʋ hɛtʋ nyəŋkʋ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ɩ kʋpɑntʋ tɑɑ kɛ́ mɑ́ hɑ mɑ təɣɩ tɑm tɔɔ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"Mɑ sɑŋɩ-ŋ tɑm tɔɔ kɛ́ pə tənɑ mpi n lɑpɑ tɔ pə tɔɔ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"nɑ mɑ́ kpɑɑləɣɩ nyɑ́ yəlɑɑ ɩsɛntɑɑ sɩ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"n kɛ́ kʋpɑŋ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/dop_sim/PSA/52.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/dop_sim/PSA/53.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/dop_sim/PSA/51.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}